---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---

<PageLayout>
	<div>
		<h1>Donate</h1>
		<br/><br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p>The best ways you can donate to us are via our <u>PayPal (<a>Click here</a>), cash donated to us in person, or supplies</u> you'd like to give us towards mutual aid for the community.</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p>For in-person supply donations, we will accept sealed foods, bottled waters/drinks, relatively clean clothes, rain coats, umbrellas, socks, shoes, packaged toiletries (e.g. deodorants, tampons, toothbrushes, toothpaste, shampoos, etc.), sleeping bags, and blankets. If you wish to donate an item that doesn't fall into one of these categories, feel free to ask us over our Instagram or in person and we'll let you know if we can accept it!</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
